<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brinker shares upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brinker shares upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it raised its rating on the shares of Brinker International Inc to a buy from a market perform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 9/16 to 14-7/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
